e City (based on Miami) push him down a different path. Featuring a wide variety of vehicles and weapons, radio stations playing hit songs from the era and an intense atmosphere, GTA: Vice City is an open-world sandbox satire of '80's Miami.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 27, "name": "Comedy"}, {"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 38, "name": "Open world"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/grand-theft-auto-vice-city", "videos": [{"id": 3544, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MpmDawqOfqs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MpmDawqOfqs", "title": "Grand Theft Auto: Vice City Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MpmDawqOfqs/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 3546, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "Iq2Jzksu8BA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iq2Jzksu8BA", "title": "Gta Vice City - Part 1 Walkthrough No Commentary", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Iq2Jzksu8BA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 18992, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Q7FZf5v4Y4U"}, {"id": 19717, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Qsx6ZMfcPUs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qsx6ZMfcPUs", "title": "Grand Theft Auto: Vice City - Anniversary Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Qsx6ZMfcPUs/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 117982, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "h4V2lzIYOIA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h4V2lzIYOIA", "title": "Behind the Scenes - GTA: Vice City [Making of]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h4V2lzIYOIA/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 120117, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "N9YvopAJEgo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=N9YvopAJEgo", "title": "GTA Vice City - Full Game Walkthrough in 4K", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N9YvopAJEgo/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 847, "name": "Grand Theft Auto"}], "characters": [{"id": 275, "name": "Jenny Louise Crab"}, {"id": 259, "name": "Jez Torrent"}, {"id": 244, "name": "Jethro"}, {"id": 269, "name": "Rep. Alex Shrus"}, {"id": 248, "name": "Mike the Goon"}, {"id": 218, "mug_shot": {